   "source": [
    "# Newton's Method\n",
    "\n",
    "The Newton-Raphson Method is a numerical algorithm for finding roots of a function.\n",
    "\n",
    "It iteratively updates an initial value until it hits the desired level of precision.\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "x_{n+1} = x_n - \\frac{f(x_n)}{f'(x_n)}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
